<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">Song of Solomon</book>
  <para style="h">Song of Solomon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Song of Solomon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Song of Solomon</para>
  <para style="mt">Song of Solomon</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hla thlan khâwmte, Solomona phuah chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Min fâwp rawh se, a hmuia fawhnate chuan, Uain hnehin a ṭha si, i hmangaihna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I hriak hnawih mi chuan a nei, rim ṭha tak mai; Rimtui bun chhuah ang a ni e, i hming zawng; Chuvâng chuan an hmangaih che, nulaten.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Min zai langin, i hniakhnung kan ûm ang che. Min hruai lût ta, lal chuan a pindan chhûngah. Nangma tâwnah kan hlimin kan lâwm ang a, Kan hril zêl ang, i hmangaihna, uain hnehin. An ngaina tak zet che a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hâng na a, ka nalh a nia, Aw Jerusalem fanute u, Kedar puan inte leh Solomona puanzârte angin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka han deuh avângin mi iai suh u, Ni sâin min em vâng a ni e. Ka nu fapate ka chungah thinurin Grêp huan vêngah mi siam ta a, Mahni huan erawh ka vêng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Min hrilh rawh, aw nang ka hmangaih chuan, I ran rual khawiah nge i châwma, Chhûn laia i chawlhtîr ṭhinna chu. Engah nge kei ka vah ka vah ang, I ṭhiante ran rual sîrah chuan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I hriat loh chuan, aw nang hmeichhia alaia mawi ber, Ran rual hniakhnungah chuan kal ta la, I kêltête châwm la, berâmpute puan in sîrah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka khaikhin thîn che, aw ka hmangaih, Pharaoa tawlailîr sakawrlâ nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A nalh mang e, i biang, bahsam phiar mawi nên, I nghâwnga lunghlu hruite nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Rangkachak ṭhi hrui kan siam ang che, Tangkaraw bel mawi neiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭhutna hmuna lalber awm laiin Ka nard rimtui chu a lêng chhuak e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu ka tân murra têl a ni, Ka ṭânglaia châm ang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu ka tân henna pâr bâwr ang, En-gedi grêp huana mi chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, i mawi e, ka hmangaih, Ngai teh, i mawi e; I mit ṭhuro ang mai a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai teh, i mawi e, ka duh tak, a ni, lungtiawi! Kan khum pawh a hring reng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kan in khanchhukte chu sidar thing, Kan inchhunte fâr thing lo ni e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lo ni e, Saron rose pâr leh phaizâwla lili.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hling zînga lili ang hi ka hmangaih chu a ni, Lanute zîngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngaw hnuai thing zînga apple thing ang Ka duh tak chu a ni, tlangvâlte zîngah. A hlimah chuan ka ṭhu, nuam takin, A rah chu ka tân a thlum ngei e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ruai ṭheh inah chuan kei mi hruai a, Ka chunga a puan zâr chu hmangaihna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Grêp thei chhanga mi tungnungin Mi tiharh teh u, apple theiin, Hmangaihnaah ka uai zo ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kut vei lam chu lukhamin, A kut ding lamin mi pawm teh se!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ngên tlat che u aw Jerusalem fanute, Saza leh ramzukpui chhâlin, Hmangaihna chu chawk thova tiharh lo tûrin; Amahin a duh hma chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka duh tak aw chu, ngai rawh, a lo kal e, Tlângah zuang ṭumin mualah a tualchai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka duh tak chuan a ang, saza emaw zuktuai emaw. Ngai rawh, a ding reng kan bang phênah, A rawn bih kha tukverhahte chuan, Zâwngdaikalh âwngah a inlan e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka duh tak chuan heti hian mi ti a: “Tho la, ka hmangaih, ka enchim loh, lo kal ta che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En teh, thlasik a ral a, Ruahtui a kangin a kiang ta si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leian pangpârte an lo lang a, Sîrva zai vâwr hun a lo thleng a, ṭhuva awrâwl hriat a ni ta, kan ramah hian;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Theipui kûngin rah a chhuah a. Grêp hruite an lo pâr vul, An rimtuinate lêng chhuakin. Tho la, ka hmangaih, ka enchim loh, lo kal ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw ka ṭhuva, lungpui keh kâra mi, Khâm chhawrdawha awm, I hmêl min hmuhtîr la, i aw min hriattîr ta che; I aw a mawi a, i hmêl lah a duhawm si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Min mansak ula, sihalte, sihalnotête, Grêp huan tichhetute chu, Kan grêp huante a pâr vul mêk si,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu ka ta a ni, kei pawh a ta ka ni e. A ran rual tlattîr ṭhîn kha, lili pâr zîngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nî a nêma hlim a her bo hma loh chuan, Ka duh tak, Bether tlâng saza, zuktuai ang chang rawh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zânan laikhum chungah ka dâwn ṭhîn, ka hmangaih chu; Ka zawng ruai e, ka tawng si lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tho vang a, khawpui daikâwm ka vêl ang, Kawtthlêrah leh mual laiahte chuan; Ka zawng zêl dâwn e, ka hmangaih chu. Ka zawng ruai e, ka tawng si lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawpui vênga kal hualtuten mi hmu a; “Ka hmangaih chu in hmu emaw?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anmahni ka pelh hnu lawkah chuan, Ka hmu ta e, ka hmangaih chu. Ka vuan ta a, ka kaltîr leh tawh rua lo, Ka nu inah, mi paitu pindan chhûngah, Amah ka hruai luh hma loh zawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ngên tlat che u, aw Jerusalem fanute, Saza leh ramzukpui chhâlin, Hmangaihna chu chawk thova tiharh lo tûrin, Amahin a duh hma chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eng nge ni hei, meikhu ding ang thlalêr ata lo kal hi, Murra leh beraw rimtui nam rum rum, Sumdâwng paudar tinrêng rim chenin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai rawh, Solomona zâwnna tawlai chu, Râlhrât sawmrukin an din hual e, Israel râlhrât zînga mite chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An zain khandaih an vawng, do thiam an ni; Mi tinin khandaih an pai, an khêl chungah, Zântianga hlauhawm vâng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal Solomonan zâwn bâwm a tân a insiam, Lebanon tlâng thing hmanrua ngeiin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A bante a siam a, tangkaruain, A nghenchhan chu rangkachakin, A ṭhutthlêng chu puan sen dukin; A chhûng lam chu an rem, duhawm takin, Jerusalem fanute chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kal chhuak ula, aw Zion fanute u, Lal Solomona chu en ru; A khumtîr kha, a nun lallukhum, A nupui neih ni, a thinlung lâwmna nîah chuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh, i mawi e, ka hmangaih, Ngai teh, i mawi e; Ṭhuro an iang e, i mitten, i hmai khuhna phênah chuan. I sam chu kêl rual, Gilead tlâng panga bawk ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I hâte chu berâmpui rual hmul meh hlim, Bual zawh hlim ang chu a ni, An zaa kawppui nei ṭheuhvin, Nei lo rêng an awm lo, an zîngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I hmuiten an iang e, sâpsen zai, I kâ pawh a duhawm ngei e. I biangten pawmgranet phel an iang e, I hmai khuhna phênah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I nghâwngin a iang e, Davida kulhbîng sâng, Râlthuam dah nâna siam chu, Phaw sângkhat an bâng e, tah chuan, Râlhrâtte phaw ṭheuh ngei chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I hnute pahnih hian a ang, no pahnih, Sazain phîr a neih, lili pâr zînga tlate chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nî a nêma, hlim a her bo hma loh chuan, Ka kal nâng e, murra tlâng leh Beraw mual lamah chuanin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I mawi zo ngei e, ka hmangaih, Nangmahah demawm a awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lebanon aṭangin lo kal ang che, ka ṭhiannu, ka hnênah, Lebanon aṭangin ka hnênah. Amana chhîpah chuan rawn chuan la; Senir leh Hermon chhîp aṭang chuan, Sakeibaknei pûk aṭang chuanin, Keitête tlâng aṭang pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thinlung i hneh zo ta, ka laina, ka ṭhiannu, Ka thinlung i hneh zo ta, i mit sîr zai vawi khatin, I nghâwng thlun pakhat nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A mawi mang e, i hmangaihna, ka laina, ka ṭhiannu! Uain hnehin i hmangaihna a ṭhat zâwkzia mai tak chu! Rimtui zawng zawng hnehin a tui zâwk i hriak rim zawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw ka ṭhiannu, i hmuiah a far e, khuaipui zû; I ṭawngkamah khawizû, hnute tui; I silhfên rim Lebanon rim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan humhalh tlat a ni,ka laina, ka ṭhiannu chu, Tuihna humhalh tlat, tuikhur hauh tlat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawmgranet hmun ang a ni, i duhawmzia, Rah ṭha ber ber chhuak ṭhîn te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Henna leh nard nên, nard leh safron nên, Fu rimtui leh thakthîng, beraw thing chi tinrêngte nên, Murra leh aloe rimtui ropui zawng nên pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang chu huan tuikhur, tui nung chhun chhuah chu i ni, Luite lo luang Lebanon tlângan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Harh la, aw hmâr thli, lo kal rawh, nang chhim thli, Ka huan hi rawn chhêm ula, a rimtui lêng chhuak rawh se. Ka duh tak chu a huanah lo lût sela, A rah ṭha ber ber chu ei rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka huanah chuan ka lo lût a, ka laina, ka ṭhiannu; Ka murra ka rimtuite nên ka lâwr khâwm a, Ka khawizu chu a thlâr chawpin ka ei a, Ka uain ka in a, hnute tui nên. Ei rawh u, aw ṭhiante u, in rawh u; A ni, in ṭeuh mai rawh u, aw ka duh takte u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka muhîl reng, ka thinlung erawh chu a harh, Chu, ka duh takin a rawn kik chu! “Min hawn rawh, ka laina, ka hmangaih, Ka ṭhuro, ka sawisêl bo, ka lû a huh zo si a, daiin, Ka sam chhâwllêng, zân dai farte chuan,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kawr ka hlîp ta, engah nge ka hâk ang? Ka ke ka sil ta, engah nge ka tihbawlhhlawh ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka duh tak chuan a rawn zen, kawngkhâr âwngah, Amah ka ngai êm e - lungrilah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka duh tak kawng hawn tûrin ka tho; Tin, ka kut chu a far a, murra-in, Murra a luang ka zungṭangahte, Kawng kalh hûmna chungah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka duh tak tân chuan ka hawng ta a; Mahse, ka duh tak lâm ang lêt e. A ṭawng ka thlâin a tuar zo lo. Ka zawng ruai e, ka tawng si lo ve, Ka au chiam a, mi chhâng si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawpui vênga kal hualtuten mi hmu a, Mi vua a, mi hliam ta a, Kulh vêngtuten an hlîp e, ka silhpuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ngên tlat che u, aw Jerusalem fanute u, Ka duh tak chu in hmuh chuanin Hmangaihnaah ka uai zo tih rawn hrilh r’u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi aiin i duh tak chu eng nge a nih bîk le, Aw hmeichhia alaia mawi ber? Mi aiin i duh tak chu eng nge a nih bîk, Chuti êma min ngen le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu a ṭha sen siar a, Sângsâwm zîngah a chungnung ber e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A luin a iang e, rangkachak thianghlim, A sam kir chu dum zên e, lianâk iangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mitte chu luite tui kam ṭhuro ang, Hnute tuia inbuala fel taka ṭhu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A biangte chu hlo rimtui hmun, rimtui chhuah ṭhîn ang a ni. A hmuite chu lili pâr ang, murra tuiin a far e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kutzungte rangkachak tlâwn, topaz lung phûm ṭhiau ang. A sakruang chu saingho, sapphir-a chei ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ke châwn chu lung vâr tlâwn, rangkachak nghahchhana hûn ang. A lan dânin Lebanon tlângpui iang e, Sidar thing ṭha chungnung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kam a thlum ber mai, a ni, a duhawm famkim. Hei hi ka duh tak chu a ni, hei hi ka ṭhian a ni, Aw Jerusalem fanute u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I duh tak chu khawiah nge a kal tâk, Aw hmeichhia alaia mawi ber? Khawi lamah nge i duh tak lâm ang a lêt, Keinin kan zawnpui theih nân che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu a chhuk ta, a huan hlo rimtui hmunah chuan, Huanah a ran rual tlattîr leh A lili pâr lâwr tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka duh tak ta chu ka ni a, ka duh tak chu ka ta a ni. A ran rual tlattîr ṭhîn kha, lili pâr zîngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I mawi mang e, aw ka duh tak, Tirza iangin, I duhawm e, Jerusalem khawpui ang; Puanzâr khai pheisen rual ang, ka zuam lo che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I mit la tawh la, ka lakan hian, Min hmin tawh êm mai si hi. I bahsamin a iang kêlchal hmul, I sam chu kêl rual, Gilead tlâng panga bawk ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I hate chu berâmpui rual bual zawh hlim ang chu a ni; An zaa kawppui nei ṭheuhvin, Nei lo rêng an awm lo, an zîngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I biangten pawmgranet phel an iang e, I hmai khuhna phênah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalnu sawmruk leh hmei sawmriat an awm a, Nula chhiar sên loh nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ṭhuro zawng pakhat a ni, ka Sawisêlbovi chu, A nu fanu neih chhun tê, a hringtunu en chim loh chu. Hmeichhiaten amah an hmu a, nihlawh an ti; A ni, lalnu leh hmeite pawhin an fak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu a ni nge zîng êng mawi ang lo lang kha, Chhawrthlapui ianga mawi leh tûrni ianga chianga, Puanzâr khai pheisen rual ang, ka zuam loh chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thei pil sak hmunah ka zuk kal a, Ruama thil chawrno en tûr leh Grêp a kuhmûm emaw, pawmgranet a pâr emaw en tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ammi-nadib tawlailîrahte ka hriat loh hlânin mi lo dah, ka châkna chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kîr rawh, kîr rawh, aw nang Sulam mi; Kîr rawh, kîr rawh, kan thlîr theih nân che. Engah nge Sulam mi i thlîr le, Mahanaim lâma lâm ang êmin?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pheikhawk bun chunga i pên mawizia, Aw mi ropui fanu! I mal mûmin lunghlu iang e, Thawktu themthiam tak kutchhuak chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I laibu lah berhbu hûn, Uain pawlh sa, kiam ngai lo ang hian. I pum chuan a iang e, buh vûm, Lili pâr hmuna chhûn chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I hnute pahnih hian a ang, no pahnih, Sazain phîr a neih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I nghâwngin a iang a ni, saingho kulhbîng sâng, I mitten Hesbon-a dîlte, Bath-rabbim luhna kianga mi ang e. I hnârin a iang a ni, Lebanon kulhbîng, Damaska lam hawi chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I thlungluin a iang Karmel tlâng, I bahsam pawh a dum ziar e; A thlai mawi lalin a tuar zo lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I mawizia leh lung i tihawizia, Aw hmangaih, lâwmnate zîngah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I tlâwntlai hian tûm thing a iang e, I hnutêten a rah bâwr a ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tûm thingah chuan ka lâwn chho vang a, A rah ka khawih ang,” ka lo ti a. I hnutêin grêp bâwr ang se, I thaw rimin apple ang bawk se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I kam uain ṭha mi ang mai chu. Ka duh tak tân luang thla dêl dêl se, Muhîlte hmuiah luang lût rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka duh tak ta chu ka ni a, Keima lamah a thinlai a châm reng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Haw teh, ka duh tak, ramah chhuak ila, Thingtlâng khuaahte i riak teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zîngah grêp huanah kal ila, I en dûn ang grêp, kuhmûmin a vul emaw, Pawmgranet pawh a pâr emaw. Tah chuan ka hlân ang che, ka hmangaihna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zâwlaidi hlovin rimtui a chhuah a, Kan kawngka bulah thei ṭha tinrêng A awm rui e, a hlui leh thar, I tân ka khêk khal, aw ka duh tak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka nuṭa, ka nu hnutê hne ve ni teh la chuan, Pâwna ka hmuh che pawhin ka fâwp ang chia; Tu mân min dem lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hruai ang chia, ka nu inah ka hruai lût ang chia, Anin mi lo zirtîr tûr. In tûr rimtui ka intîr ang chia, Ka pawmgranet tui ngei chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kut vei lam chu lukhamin A kut ding lamin mi pawm teh se!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ngên tlat che u, aw Jerusalem fanute u, Hmangaihna chu chawk thova tiharh lo tûrin, Amahin a duh hma chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu nge ni hei, thlalêr ata lo chhova, A duh taka rinchhani hi? Apple thing hnuaiah ka tiharh chia. I nun a veinaah che khân, Tah chuan a hringtu che chuan a vei che kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Min dah ta che, i ṭângah valṭhi angin, I bânah bânbun iangin; Thihna angin a chak si, hmangaihna hi, Thîkna chu Seol angin a nunrâwng; A alh chhuak chu mei alh chhuak a lo ni a, Meialh nasa tak mai chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tui tam takin a tidai thei lo, hmangaihna zawng, Tuilianin a chîm pil thei hek lo. Miin a in ro zawng zawng hmangaihna atan a pêk zawh chuan Hmuhsitin a awm ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Farnu tê tak tê chu kan nei a, A la um khêl lo, a hnutê pawh. Eng nge kan tih ang, kan farnu tân, Ama tân biahthu an hlan ni chuan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah chu kulh bang lo ni se, Tangkaraw kulhbîng kan siamsak ang; Amah chu kawngka lo ni sela, Sidar thing phelin kan tuam leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ni alâwm, kulh bang, Ka hnutêin a ang, kulhbîng sângte; A mit hmuhah chuan muanna neitu ka lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomonan a nei grêp huan, Baal-hamon-ah; Huanpute hnênah chuan grêp huan chu a kawltîr a. Mi tinin thei man tangkaraw sângkhat lâk tûr an nei ṭheuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka grêp huan chu ka ta liau liau, keima tân ngei a ni; Aw Solomon, nang chuan sâng i nei a, Huanpute chuan zahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang, huanahte chêng ṭhînnu, ṭhiante chuan i aw an ngaithla a - Min ngaihthlâktîr ve ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmanhmawh ta che, ka duh tak, Rimtui tlânga saza emaw, zuktuai emaw ang chang rawh.
  </para>
</usx>
